                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Adada gucokke gugurre kacel i gaŋ man i kom laticci maleŋ twal Yecu, en ma in iwiro ki moo, gin Kerode ki Pontio Pilato, kacel ki Lurok ki jo Icrael ducu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pi tiyo ducu ma yam iyubo pi tweroni ki mitti ni myero otimme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo, Rwot, doŋ inen bura megi, ci imi wan luticci watit lokki ki tekcwiny laboŋo lworo mo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun in iryeyo ciŋi me caŋo dano, wek lanyut ki taŋo mapol otimme i nyiŋ laticci Yecu maleŋ twal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gutyeko lega, ci kabedo ma gugurre iye-ni oyeŋŋe, gin ducu gupoŋ ki Cwiny Maleŋ, ci gutito lok pa Lubaŋa ki tekcwiny laboŋo lworo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
